The driver provides measurements from the AHT20 humidity/tempera‐
ture sensors via the framework.  The argument selects the address
at  the bus.  The crc validity can be changed through nodes.  The
following variables are provided: If set, the crc calculation for
%RH and temperature will be ignored.  If the driver  is  compiled
with  this  node will appear and can be used to set the debugging
level.  To read %RH or temperature the  chip  requires  that  the
command  be sent, then a delay must be observed before a read can
be done to get the values back.  The delays are documented in the
datasheet for the chip.  The driver will attempt to read back the
values readattempts number of times.  The  default  is  10  which
should  be  more than enough for most purposes.  The driver first
